  IDs used as View.setTag/getTag keys rather than as view identifiers.

  card_media_item lets a global focus listener recover which MediaItem a
  freshly-focused card represents without every screen threading the item
  through its own focus callback - see MediaCardAdapter and CardTooltipController.
-->
